/.quarto/

# The built site. `quarto publish gh-pages` renders it here and pushes it to
# the gh-pages branch; it is not kept on main.
/_site/

# CV source and build files stay out of the repository. The PDF, when it is
# present in this folder, is still published as a site resource.
/VK_CV_onlinelong.*
/altacv.cls
/pdfa.xmpi
/VK_2024.jpg

/.jupyter_cache/

/.luarc.json

**/*.quarto_ipynb

# replication archive (100MB, exceeds GitHub file limit)
/Roots of terror.zip

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Quarto scratch notebooks (the numbered variants the engine leaves behind)
**/*.quarto_ipynb_*

# R console history
.Rhistory

# BibDesk / editor autosave leftovers
*.sav.tmp

# RStudio state and saved R workspaces
.Rproj.user
.RData

# Seminar 2024 working folder: raw data, knitr caches, RStudio state and the
# full set of teaching files (half a gigabyte, with single files over GitHub's
# 100 MB limit). It stays on this machine. What the site publishes is the
# small curated copy in teaching/reproducible-research/.
/seminar_2024/
